== Text equivalent ==
TPM has five layers. The Prime Kernel (TPK, TPS 2.2) maps through the Translation Manifold (TrM, 2.3) into an environment; results are kept in the Research Register (RR, part 3). The Congruence Protocol (part 4) audits the register and strikes contradictions, taking its parameters from the Measure Set (TMS, 2.4), the third zone of the Full Kernel. The Public Recorder (part 5), in three parts PLATFORM, TPX and PRB, hosts every page and executes every MECHANICAL check (5.1.1, 5.1.3).

